Package: MaligCTG
Type: Package
Title: Malignant Cell Annotation with Cancer-Testis Genes
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Chunyang", family = "Fu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "fuchunyang012@163.com")
Description: Score cells against malignant-like and normal-like references
    defined by detected cancer-testis gene burden in raw Seurat counts.
    Optionally assign binary malignant labels using Gaussian mixtures or Otsu
    thresholds and the intersection of both reference-score decisions.
